1133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Moreover, a user profile is created to capture the behaviour and interests of a watcher. Then, the content is sent to your feed based on your predicted engagement with it. Posts and reels are ranked based on their likelihood to draw you in, so the first reel that you see when you open Instagram is always the one lucky enough to be in the first place. The algorithm is also very adaptive: it will mirror your shifts in content consumption within milliseconds.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
>>
